WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.800
SCP-682 Vs SCP-923. Can this terrifying,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:10.400
mind-melting satellite finally drive SCP-682&nbsp;
off the edge? Foundation researchers damaged&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:16.000
682 heavily and took it out to an isolated&nbsp;
field in Kansas in order to find out.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.680
SCP-923 fired down at 682 with its&nbsp;
beam set to Intensity level 75,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:26.080
known to have devastating effects against&nbsp;
the minds of its victims. When the blast was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:31.760
unleashed, 682 began screaming and howling&nbsp;
obscenities at the sky and the Foundation.

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:36.800
Then, its body began to adapt, growing&nbsp;
glowing nodes that fired out its own beams&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:43.600
similar to 923’s blasts, driving the observing&nbsp;
Foundation employees completely insane.

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:47.440
The test was considered such a failure&nbsp;
that one of the lead researchers on the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:53.600
SCP-682 termination project threatened to do&nbsp;
something REDACTED to whoever organized it.

